# Spec-driven development

Truth hierarchy (same spirit as python-services / edge-agent packs):

1. Consumer **`docs/specification/product/`** — what to build
2. Consumer **`docs/specification/adr/`** — accepted engineering law
3. Consumer **`docs/specification/as-built/`** — what is live
4. This constitution — how to code
5. Code

When behaviour changes, update the matching spec/ADR/as-built in the **same
PR** as code when the consumer follows SDD delivery.

